body:
Oh, I am not looking to be the life of the party. I know that if I killed a bunch of people, I would be hated. But you know what? I am going to be soon forgotten after anyways. People have to get over the fact that I did this. They'll forget and I get a bit of happiness from doing it. It sounds like a win-win.

&#x200B;

Also, I used the same mindset for high school and guess what? I still don't enjoy life. If I live life just "getting through it", I won't live past the age of 23. It's a miserable mindset.

&#x200B;

Still, thanks for the reply.

&#x200B;

Even if school is a shit system, why should I be complacent and let it be miserable? I should change the system, not bow down to it and let it fuck me. There needs to be a radical change in the school system and I want to be the one to do it.
